Z||000000||stimpy||07-10-2001||11:27 PM||||I tried to be nice about it a couple of weeks ago, and some people actually got the hint, but the way some people abuse the signature feature is got me ready to shoot blood out of my eyeballs!<BR>I'm calling open season on these little freaks who feel that it is imperative to subject me to their full-screen signature pics over and over again. In one thread currently on general chat, out of 21 posts, one sig file is repeated SEVEN FREAKIN TIMES!!!! And it's HUGE! And STUPID on top of that. Give it a rest people! You know who you are. And if you don't, ole stimpy is fixin to come tell you. Prepare to feel the sting of my wrath, bandwith bandits, I'm a gonna git cha!<P>I ask that anyone who feels the same way not only add their sentiments, but feel free to post a link to this thread if you feel someone is being abusive. Remember folks, it takes a village to preserve a forum.<P>||||reg||13
Z||000001||Shaft||07-10-2001||11:56 PM||||You read my mind. I've been thinkin the same thing lately. If people are going to post multiple times on a topic they should at least have the courtesy to only show the sig once so all of us on dial-ups don't have to wait so long for a page to load.||||reg||1
Z||000002||FieroJoe||07-10-2001||11:59 PM||||I totally agree!  I too added my comments to said thread, and I asked the user politely to downsize the pic and not use their sig all the time in a previous thread.<P>I assume you are referring to this thread:<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/008707.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/008707.html</A> <P>Anyways, yes, I have very slow bandwidth and I rarely use my sig anymore as well.  I do not enjoy waiting for a bunch of pictures to load in a thread, thinking that they may be pictures of Fieros or something, and find out that they are some stupid looking cartoon.<P>I also find the extrememly long text sigs quite annoying, when used in every single post, of course.<P>You get 'em stimpy, we don't need no little pansy's shooting them qwar pics all over our Forum!<BR>||||reg||1
